@baseUrl = http://localhost:9001

# Asset analysis: the LLM summary, meeting notes and distilled ideas of a text
# asset, as a workspace lens and one lens per campaign the asset serves. All
# endpoints require authentication; run "Login" from sessions/sessions.http
# first. Set assetId (a ready MD/PDF/URL/DOC/AUDIO asset) and campaignId.

### Every lens of an asset, with the ideas each distilled  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{assetId}}/analyses
Accept: application/json

### The workspace lens  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{assetId}}/analysis
Accept: application/json

### One campaign's lens  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{assetId}}/analysis?campaign_id={{campaignId}}
Accept: application/json

### Retry a failed or skipped workspace lens (expects 202, or 409 analysis_not_retryable)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{assetId}}/analysis/retry

### Retry a failed or skipped campaign lens  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{assetId}}/analysis/retry?campaign_id={{campaignId}}

### A campaign's asset analyses, most relevant first  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/asset-analyses
Accept: application/json

### Ideas distilled by analyses  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ideas?origin=asset_analysis
Accept: application/json

### Ideas distilled from one asset  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ideas?asset_id={{assetId}}
Accept: application/json

### Live status changes (asset.analysis.updated) for an asset and a campaign  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?topics=entity:asset:{{assetId}},entity:campaign:{{campaignId}}
Accept: text/event-stream
